**Layout on main.** The modules sit under `lib.rs`'s inline `pub mod starling_native`, using the canonical `native_starling_spec` types:
- `kernels`: `nearest_cells` and `ring_select`;
- `murmuration` (S1);
- `murmuration_tree` (S2);
